(11, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>WiseTech Core is built for fast technology websites: software reviews, tutorials, comparison pages, and content-driven publications. Use this page to introduce your editorial mission, your team, or your expertise.</p><p>Because this is starter content, you can edit or delete it any time.</p>', 'About', '', 'auto-draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?page_id=11', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(12, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>Add your preferred contact method here: email, a contact form, social media, or your business address.</p><ul><li>Email: hello@example.com</li><li>Editorial inquiries: editor@example.com</li></ul>', 'Contact', '', 'auto-draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?page_id=12', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(13, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent rutrum ipsum eu laoreet pulvinar.</p><p>Pellentesque vitae ipsum non augue porta tincidunt. Donec eget orci eget urna gravida tristique.</p><p>Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae.</p>', 'Sample Featured Post', 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nulla facilisi in porta euismod.', 'auto-draft', 'open', 'open', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=13', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(14, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Fusce interdum pretium orci, et dignissim erat.</p><p>Ut condimentum, nisi at ultrices feugiat, purus justo aliquet nulla, non sodales turpis sapien et ante.</p>', 'Another Sample Article', 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Maecenas consequat magna eget risus.', 'auto-draft', 'open', 'open', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=14', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(15, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>Duis mattis, justo vel suscipit pharetra, lacus mauris commodo arcu, sed ultrices orci libero in purus.</p><p>Nam at odio finibus, volutpat erat et, malesuada sapien. Morbi sagittis justo sit amet dui.</p>', 'Example Blog Post', 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent at augue non sem tempor.', 'auto-draft', 'open', 'open', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=15', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(16, 1, '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<p>Aliquam et lectus sit amet nibh hendrerit tempor in sit amet leo. Donec id ipsum tortor.</p><p>Aenean sit amet sapien facilisis, efficitur ligula nec, rutrum lectus. Integer maximus accumsan nisl.</p>', 'Sample Article Title', 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Integer in orci sed velit posuere.', 'auto-draft', 'open', 'open', '', '', '', '', '2026-11-10 16:09:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=16', 0, 'post', '', 0),
